WEBVTT

00:08:29.713 --> 00:08:33.259
Arguments were heard this week,
and in my view,

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:37.221
we are likely to see
at least five justices

00:08:37.263 --> 00:08:39.682
overrule Roe and Casey

00:08:39.723 --> 00:08:44.395
and send the question of abortion
back to the states.

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:47.398
Sesame Street, five votes.

00:08:47.398 --> 00:08:50.985
And unfortunately, this time around,

00:08:51.026 --> 00:08:54.488
there is no Justice Kennedy to save us.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:09:01.078
Now, what's going to happen
when Roe and Casey are overturned?